# Generated DP EMS tables are BYTE-DETERMINISTIC artifacts: regenerating one
# with the same inputs must reproduce the same file, and the generator prints a
# sha256 so that is checkable.  This repository is developed with
# core.autocrlf=true, which would store LF in the index and check CRLF out into
# the working tree — after which a freshly generated table (written with
# newline="" and explicit \n) no longer matches the checked-out one, and the
# determinism check reports a spurious difference.
#
# `-text` disables all end-of-line conversion for these files, so what is
# committed is what is checked out is what the generator wrote.
#
# Scoped to this directory on purpose: it must not change how any other file in
# the repository is handled.
*.csv -text
